---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Camp school" description="Camp school on Røvær. Outdoor life and coastal culture for students since 1986." lang="en" page="campSchool">
  <div class="page">
    <h1 class="page-title">Camp school</h1>
    <p class="page-intro">
      Since it started in 1986, all primary school pupils in Haugesund have attended
      camp school on Røvær. Around 500 pupils from Haugesund visit the camp school
      each year. In addition, pupils in years 6–7 from Odda municipality attend.
    </p>

    <div class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Theory and practice</h2>
      <img class="section-img" src="/images/Rvr_DSC0084-Edit-500x325.jpg" alt="Students on the sea at Røvær">
      <p>
        Here, sea and sky meet. In both theory and practice. Mostly practice.
        Most of the time is spent outdoors, surrounded by the shapes and colours,
        sounds and smells of nature. In sun and rain, in storm and calm.
      </p>
      <p>
        The pupils learn about fishing with nets, pots, longlines and rods,
        processing the catch, marine life in the tidal zone, practical boat
        handling in rowing boats and canoes, sailing on the sailboat Duen,
        local history, ropework and knots, birdlife and teamwork.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Practical information</h2>
      <img class="section-img" src="/images/Sjohus-500x333.jpg" alt="Sjøhuset on Røvær">
      <ul>
        <li>Season: early March to the end of October</li>
        <li>Capacity: one class at a time (32 beds)</li>
        <li>Accommodation in Sjøhuset, a restored herring saltery from 1892</li>
        <li>Rooms for 6–8 pupils</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <div class="section">
      <h2 class="section-title">Contact</h2>
      <div class="info-box">
        <h3>Espen Martens</h3>
        <p class="contact-line">
          Email: <a href="mailto:espen.martens@haugesund.kommune.no">espen.martens@haugesund.kommune.no</a>
        </p>
        <p class="contact-line">Phone: 992 52 179</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
